        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 936AR, Contemporary Clear Knob with Arched Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFrom the new <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Hardware</b></a> collection the 936AR is evidence that combining contrasting styles, of the contemporary clear knob with a classic design arched plate just looks great.  The Omnia 936AR clear glass door knobset is available in 7 finishes choices.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 936AR Contemporary Clear Knob with Arched Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 936AR Contemporary Clear Knob with Arched Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arched Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arched Rose Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Clear Knob with Arched Plate, Omnia 936AR",
                "description": "From the new Omnia Prodigy Hardware collection the 936AR is evidence that combining contrasting styles, of the contemporary clear knob with a classic design arched plate just looks great.  The Omnia 936AR clear glass door knobset is available in 7 finishes choices.",
